// Governor traits (GAMEOPTION_GOVERNORS; this game's own rules, docs/GOVERNORS.md): small
//     modifiers of the city a governor holds. A governor has 0 to GOVERNOR_MAX_TRAITS of them, drawn
//     with weight 1 + the leader's flavors named in Flavors (so a leader's candidates lean its way).
//     iBuildingProductionPercent / iUnitProductionPercent: production toward buildings / units;
//     iHappy, iHealth: faces; YieldModifiers: food, production, commerce %; CommerceModifiers: gold,
//     research, culture, espionage %; iExperience: experience of the units trained there.
[
  {
    "type": "GOVERNORTRAIT_INDUSTRIOUS",
    "description": "TXT_KEY_GOVERNORTRAIT_INDUSTRIOUS",
